    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tgvu](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tgvu) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on Jul 30 2026 31km S of Waff. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -2.6018 longitude 138.8205. It impacted 8211 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
